     ./configure

   results in

      Configuring for a alpha-dec-osf1.3 host.
      *** This configuration is not supported in the following subdirectories:
	   libg++ libio
	  (Any other directories should still work fine.)
      Created "Makefile" in /usr/local/archive/libg++-2.5.3

First:

Search for `alpha' in configure.in and delete libg++ and libio from
the `noconfigdirs' variable.

Second:

Change the reference to __alpha__ in libio/floatconv.c to __alpha.

Third:

Rerun ./configure and build the installation.

That compiles OK.  Whether it works properly or not it another matter...

Ray.
