function declaration rules.

You probably want to use the <stdarg.h> style variatic functions (the
ANSI C versions), which means something like:

void
xxprint(int err, char *s, ...)
{
    va_list vl;
    va_start(vl, s);
    arg1 = va_arg(vl, type1);
    arg2 = va_arg(vl, type2);
    ...

    va_end(vl);
}
