The following was posted a little while ago to the alpha-osf-managers
mailing list.

]Many thanks to the managers on this list.  Other osf-managers have
]confirmed that OSF/1 V1.3 sendmail.cf does not handle addresses of the
]form "user%one%two@org.com" properly.  IDA sendmail or sendmail version
]8.6.1 are reported to not have this problem.
]
]I had many recommendations on how to fix, the most straightforward was from
]Todd Kaehler <kaehler@zk3.dec.com> who wrote:
]
]> This is a bug when you do not have DECnet setup.  To fix, you need to
]> exit before  your -2-.  I would suggest you changed:
]> 
]> $+@$+<@$+>             $1%$2<@$3>              a@b@c@d ->a%b%c@d
]> 
]> To
]> 
]> $+@$+<@$+>		$1%$2<@$3>		a@b@c@d ->a%b%c@d
]> $+<@$+>		$@$>7$1<@$2>    
]> 
]> 
]> --Todd
]
]I have tested and confirmed that this fixes the problem.
]
